<title>UK: MEPC year pretax profit rises, NAV drops.</title>
<headline>MEPC year pretax profit rises, NAV drops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.9		   vs 21.0</p>
<p> Total Dividend (pence) 20.0		   vs 20.0</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    140.0		  vs 122.6</p>
<p> Net asset value(pence) 450.0		  vs 457.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 125.1 and 135.1 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - MEPC Plc</p>
